[h1]Cosmic Overhaul[/h1]
[i]The ultimate immersion, economy, and dynamic event expansion for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic Overhaul?[/h2]
The universe just got a lot more dangerous, and a lot more lucrative. [b]Cosmic Overhaul[/b] adds a massive living background simulation to vanilla Avorion. Factions suffer famines, dynamic weather sweeps across the map, smugglers run a real black-market economy, and idle captains can be put to work as Station Governors. [b]v5.3.0[/b] brings a full Fleet Operations dashboard rework: live income tracking, idle-ship surfacing, and at-a-glance fleet health straight from your Player Window.

[b]Dependency:[/b] Cosmic Overhaul requires [b]Cosmic Vault[/b], the shared foundation library behind every Cosmic Series mod. It runs great standalone on top of that, and unlocks extra synergy mechanics automatically if you also run [b]Cosmic War[/b], [b]Cosmic Chronicles[/b], and/or [b]Cosmic Ascendancy[/b] — no extra setup required.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🆕 v5.3.0 Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*]🎖️ [b]Fleet Operations & Earnings Dashboard:[/b] The Command Center tab is now a real dashboard — a live Fleet Income tracker, an idle-ship list that used to be silently skipped, and an "Attention Needed" strip for ships that are idle, about to finish, or recalled. Every column sorts.
[*]💹 [b]Smarter Factory Overview:[/b] New Location and Status columns show where a factory is and why it's stalled, plus a Totals summary across your whole industrial empire.
[*]🏗️ [b]Live Fleet Health:[/b] The Fleet Status Screen now shows real hull durability percentages for every tracked ship, and pulses the HUD bar when one drops critically low so damage doesn't go unnoticed.
[/list]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🧠 [b]Ascendant Neural Implants:[/b] Transform your ship into a biomechanical dreadnought with god-tier scaling.
[*]🌩️ [b]Subspace Weather Hazards:[/b] Dynamic Ion Storms and Solar Flares ravage sectors, penalizing map commands and stripping shields.
[*]👑 [b]Station Governors:[/b] Assign idle Captains to stations for massive buffs! Smuggler Governors bypass siege blockades, while Merchants boost passive income.
[*]📉 [b]Famine & Sieges:[/b] War Zones dynamically blockade stations. Severe famines inflict crushing 50% shield and 30% velocity debuffs on entire factions.
[*]💼 [b]The Syndicate Hub:[/b] Smuggler's Market overhaul! Fence unbranded stolen goods and rare tech for a serious premium, but beware of Syndicate Heat causing devastating raids.
[*]🛠️ [b]Fleet Repair QoL:[/b] Instantly repair all damaged private or Alliance ships in a sector at a Repair Dock with one click.
[*]🪨 [b]Asteroid Persistence & Regeneration:[/b] Stripped asteroid fields slowly regenerate over real-time (even offline!). Famines pause ecology, and empty sectors may spawn Emergency Replenishment anomalies.
[*]🚀 [b]Smart Travel & Gate Priorities:[/b] Galaxy Map enchaining now actively prioritizes gate networks and wormholes instead of blindly jumping.
[*]🏪 [b]Shop Restock Button:[/b] Natively refresh inventories at Equipment Docks and Merchants without closing the window!
[*]🗑️ [b]Scrapyard Freedom:[/b] Time limits and friction at scrapyards have been completely removed.
[*]🔧 [b]Permanent Subsystem Removal:[/b] Remove subsystems permanently at Shipyards, Outposts, and Repair Docks!
[*]📛 [b]NPC Ship Naming Overhaul:[/b] Military and industrial NPC ships now dynamically scale their names (e.g., from Interceptors up to Dreadnoughts and Planet Crackers) based on volume!
[*]🏴‍☠️ [b]Wreckages Tab:[/b] A UI tab in Strategy Mode sorts every wreck in the sector by size and distance. Scavenger captains will even reveal their original ship names!
[*]👔 [b]Captain Synergies:[/b] Map operations (Mine, Salvage, etc.) heavily reward specialized captains with up to 25% faster times and extended ranges! Active Piloting grants 15% discounts for Merchants and Smugglers.
[*]📦 [b]Cargo Stacking UI:[/b] Modernized Cargo UI featuring live search, sorting, illegal cargo bars, and RMB "Stacking" to instantly top-off inventories.
[*]📊 [b]Resource HUD:[/b] A customizable, native HUD widget tracking credits, resources, cargo space, and inventory in real-time.
[*]📉 [b]Dynamic Reputation Decay:[/b] Ignored factions slowly drift to neutral. Your personal reputation changes also mirror to your Alliance!
[*]💰 [b]Profitable Stations:[/b] Player stations generate passive income from civilian traffic, but profits plummet if the sector enters a [i]Cosmic War[/i]!
[*]📜 [b]Universal Bulletin Board:[/b] Access missions instantly from a player UI without docking everywhere. Features sorting and dynamic filtering!
[/list]

